WEBVTT

00:04:27.638 --> 00:04:32.143
So, he jumped onto Pegasus 
and urged him higher and higher.

00:04:33.144 --> 00:04:37.773
Zeus watched as Bellerophon,
buoyed by hubris,

00:04:37.773 --> 00:04:39.650
neared his palace.

00:04:40.026 --> 00:04:44.405
To punish the youth, 
he released a single gadfly,

00:04:44.405 --> 00:04:48.576
which beelined towards Pegasus 
and bit into his flesh.

00:04:49.327 --> 00:04:52.705
This was as high 
as Bellerophon would ever get.

00:04:53.039 --> 00:04:57.335
As Pegasus flinched, 
he flung his rider into the air,

00:04:57.543 --> 00:05:01.088
and Bellerophon fell careening
back to Earth.